kiku mixed-licence notice
==========================

This repository contains both hardware-design material and software. Project-
authored material is licensed by scope as follows.

1. CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 - Permissive (CERN-OHL-P-2.0)

   Applies to project-authored hardware, electronics and mechanical design
   material, including the root KiCad project, project-authored manufacturing
   outputs, Mechanical/ design files and exports, and hardware/mechanical
   documentation, except for software/scripts and material carrying a separate
   upstream licence notice.

   Full text: LICENSES/CERN-OHL-P-2.0.txt

2. MIT License

   Applies to project-authored software and scripts, including Firmware/ code,
   Mechanical/scripts/, and .github/workflows/, except for files or portions
   carrying a separate upstream licence notice.

   Full text: LICENSES/MIT.txt

3. General project documentation

   The root README and other project-authored documentation that spans both the
   hardware and software portions may be used under either CERN-OHL-P-2.0 or the
   MIT License, at your option, unless the file states otherwise.

Third-party material
--------------------

Third-party code, submodules and files or portions with their own copyright or
licence notices remain under those upstream terms. This includes, without
limitation, STM32/CMSIS material, FreeRTOS, FatFs, minimp3 and any other upstream
material identified by an in-file notice or licence file. Nothing in this notice
relicenses third-party material.

Component/vendor CAD, BM83 firmware/configuration tools and other excluded
third-party assets described in README.md and Mechanical/REFERENCE_GEOMETRY.md
are not distributed as project-owned material and are not covered by this
licence grant.

SPDX licence identifiers used by this repository:

  CERN-OHL-P-2.0
  MIT
